(Project Structure \(Presentation-Ready\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Purpose) Tj
T*
(- Local AI coding agent for multi-project development.) Tj
T*
(- Uses LLM providers \(OpenRouter, Hugging Face, Mistral\) with safe tool execution.) Tj
T*
(- Enforces project isolation under workspace/.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. High-Level Architecture) Tj
T*
(- main.py: entrypoint.) Tj
T*
(- openrouter_agent/cli.py: command router and interactive loop.) Tj
T*
(- openrouter_agent/agents/core.py: plan -> execute -> review/fix runtime.) Tj
T*
(- openrouter_agent/providers/: model routing, discovery, ranking.) Tj
T*
(- openrouter_agent/tools/: file/shell operations + tool schemas.) Tj
T*
(- plugins.py + plugins/: extension system.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. Core Runtime Flow) Tj
T*
(- User prompt or slash command.) Tj
T*
(- Planner generates task steps.) Tj
T*
(- Executor runs steps with bounded tool iterations.) Tj
T*
(- Optional reviewer/fixer rounds for autonomous correction.) Tj
T*
(- Logs/audit/checkpoints persisted per active project.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. Project Isolation Model) Tj
T*
(- All project work lives in workspace/<project>/.) Tj
T*
(- Per-project memory, session, index, command history, and task history.) Tj
T*
(- Git operations scoped to active project repository.) Tj
T*
(- Path normalization/safety blocks traversal outside project boundary.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(5. Safety & Governance) Tj
T*
(- Shell command validation and confirmation gates.) Tj
T*
(- Dry-run mode for mutation preview.) Tj
T*
(- Edit-scope enforcement in /edit and scoped worker subagents.) Tj
T*
(- Plugin hook capabilities for policy control.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(6. Extensibility) Tj
T*
(- Plugin manifest: plugins.json.) Tj
T*
(- Plugin modules can add slash commands and lifecycle hooks.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(7. Operational Data Layout) Tj
T*
(- workspace/: managed projects.) Tj
T*
(- logs/: per-project audit/history/runs.) Tj
T*
(- backups/: pre-edit file backups.) Tj
T*
(- snapshots/: ZIP exports/snapshots.) Tj
T*
(- SKILL/: guidance packs.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(8. Quality & Testing) Tj
T*
(- tests/ covers CLI, isolation, shell safety, providers, plugins, runtime, checkpoints.) Tj
T*
(- Run: python -m unittest discover -s tests -v) Tj
T*
() Tj
